Grok Build (grok) is SpaceXAI's terminal-based AI coding agent: a fullscreen
TUI that edits files, runs shell commands, and manages long-running tasks.

This FreeBSD port is a work-in-progress. It builds the open-source harness from
the frebsd-port-plan branch of the grok-build tree. Sandbox isolation on FreeBSD
uses a jail backend (Phase 2 helper still landing); Landlock/Seatbelt nono is
Linux/macOS only. Install textproc/ripgrep for the system rg binary — the
release build does not auto-download BurntSushi FreeBSD assets.

WWW: https://x.ai/cli
